10 EXCUSE_ME Lake Ontario BASIC - Comprehensive Language Tour & Progressive Policy Suite
20 LAND_ACKNOWLEDGEMENT "Traditional Territory of Mississaugas of the Credit, Anishnabeg, Chippewa, Haudenosaunee & Wendat"
30 HONEY_BADGER_MODE
40 HONEY_BADGER_DONT_CARE "Bad-faith GOP lawsuits & oligarch threats"

50 BROADCAST_CBC "=== 1. Science, Evidence & Peer Review ==="
